1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,540
March 1987, £2.40

2
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:04,200
on a pasty I

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,580
didn't even want.

4
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:06,219
I've written next

5
00:00:06,219 --> 00:00:09,140
to it in pencil, "Hungry?

6
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:09,339
No.

7
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:10,500
Bored."

8
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:12,640
Forty years later,

9
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:13,619
still the best lesson

10
00:00:13,619 --> 00:00:15,119
in this whole notebook.

11
00:00:15,119 --> 00:00:16,199
So much of what goes

12
00:00:16,199 --> 00:00:17,339
out isn't hunger,

13
00:00:17,339 --> 00:00:19,140
love, it's boredom.

14
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:20,239
Bored at the till,

15
00:00:20,239 --> 00:00:20,780
bored on your

16
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:21,539
phone at 11:00

17
00:00:21,539 --> 00:00:22,260
at night with your

18
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:23,739
card saved in it.

19
00:00:23,739 --> 00:00:25,219
£2.40.

20
00:00:25,219 --> 00:00:26,699
I can still taste it.

21
00:00:26,699 --> 00:00:27,199
It wasn't even

22
00:00:27,199 --> 00:00:27,859
a good pasty.

